  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.experimental_reactor.header": "实验反应堆：搭建",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.experimental_reactor.text_1": "用反应堆外壳搭建5×5×5框架，棱边只能放外壳。",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.experimental_reactor.text_2": "内部可自行安排燃料列和控制棒列的位置、数量，空余列可留空。",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.experimental_reactor.text_3": "每列燃料棒竖直叠满三格，正上方安装换料端口。",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.experimental_reactor.text_4": "控制棒列内部留空，顶部安装驱动器；它只影响四向相邻的燃料列。",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.experimental_reactor.text_5": "侧面非棱边处安装1个仪表端口，至少1个冷却剂输入口和1个热冷却剂输出口。",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.experimental_reactor.text_6": "冷热端口都可以安装多个，按管路布局安排在合法的侧面位置。",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.experimental_reactor.text_7": "封闭全部外壁；观察窗可以替换侧面非棱边处的外壳。",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.experimental_reactor.text_8": "用扳手检查仪表端口，确认结构完整后再装料。",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.experimental_reactor_rods.header": "实验反应堆：燃料棒与控制棒",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.experimental_reactor_rods.text_1": "燃料列和控制棒列的位置、数量可以自行安排；布局决定产热和控制范围。",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.experimental_reactor_rods.text_2": "四向相邻且已装料的燃料列会互相增强，形成并联超频；对角相邻不参与。",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.experimental_reactor_rods.text_3": "超频会提高产热，也会加快燃料消耗；相邻燃料列越多，反馈越强。",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.experimental_reactor_rods.text_4": "控制棒只约束四向相邻的燃料列；插入越深，功率越低。",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.experimental_reactor_rods.text_5": "一列燃料同时相邻多根控制棒时，功率按这些棒的平均插入深度约束。",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.experimental_reactor_rods.text_6": "将相邻控制棒全部插到底，才能停止该列裂变；红石停机同样通过插棒生效。",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.experimental_reactor_rods.text_7": "没有控制棒相邻的燃料列，装料后就以未受抑制的最高功率持续运行。",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.experimental_reactor_rods.text_8": "这种燃料列无法用控制棒或红石停止，也不能取出正在放热的燃料；只能等待燃料耗尽。",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.experimental_reactor_operation.header": "实验反应堆：运行与停机",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.experimental_reactor_operation.text_1": "启动前先接通冷却回路，并确认燃料已装入。",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.experimental_reactor_operation.text_2": "调节驱动器上的控制棒插入深度，逐步提棒开始产热；插得越深，功率越低。",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.experimental_reactor_operation.text_3": "冷却剂从冷端进入，吸热后从热端排出。保持输入和输出畅通。",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.experimental_reactor_operation.text_4": "用工程师护目镜查看仪表端口的产热、冷却速率和冷却剂库存。",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.experimental_reactor_operation.text_5": "停机时完全插入各控制棒。仪表端口接收红石信号后，会同时插入所有可动作的控制棒。",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.experimental_reactor_operation.text_6": "裂变停止后仍有余热，继续循环冷却剂，直到堆芯冷却。",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.experimental_reactor_operation.text_7": "撤去仪表端口的红石信号后，控制棒会恢复先前的目标位置。",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.experimental_reactor_refueling.header": "实验反应堆：装料与换料",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.experimental_reactor_refueling.text_1": "每个换料端口对应下方的一列燃料，一次容纳1个燃料组件。",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.experimental_reactor_refueling.text_2": "结构完整且燃料列停止裂变时，手持浓缩铀燃料组件右击端口装入。",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.experimental_reactor_refueling.text_3": "燃料耗尽后，会变成枯竭铀燃料组件。",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.experimental_reactor_refueling.text_4": "换料前先插入相邻控制棒，等目标燃料列停止裂变；余热仍要继续冷却。",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.experimental_reactor_refueling.text_5": "空手右击取出旧组件，再装入新的燃料组件。",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.experimental_reactor_refueling.text_6": "自动换料使用动力机械臂，普通漏斗无法装卸燃料组件。",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.enrichment_centrifuge.header": "铀料浆富集离心机",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.enrichment_centrifuge.text_1": "离心机将铀料浆分离为低浓缩铀粉、贫化铀粉和可回收的水。",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.enrichment_centrifuge.text_2": "设备占两格高度，上方留出进料管道的空间。",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.enrichment_centrifuge.text_3": "从底部输入动力，转速稳定后开始加工。",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.enrichment_centrifuge.text_4": "铀料浆只能从顶部输入。",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.enrichment_centrifuge.text_5": "每1000 mB铀料浆可分离出1份低浓缩铀粉、7份贫化铀粉和1000 mB水。提高转速可以加快加工。",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.enrichment_centrifuge.text_6": "上下两段的四个侧面都能输出粉末和水。用黄铜漏斗分开收集两种粉末，用管道回收水。",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.enrichment_centrifuge.text_7": "动力中断、转速不稳或输出受阻时，加工会暂停，进度会保留。",
  "create_nuclear_industry.ponder.enrichment_centrifuge.text_8": "轴承耗尽后，先停止动力，再手持1个重型轴承右击下段正面进行维修。",
